{
  "name": "Mobile Webhook Router",
  "active": false,
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1"
  },
  "meta": {
    "description": "Voice-to-text mobile command router: a POST webhook feeds Claude 3.5 Sonnet, which routes intent to MODIFY_WORKFLOW (n8n REST API), GENERATE_SCRIPT (write .ps1/.py to disk), or EXECUTE_API (HaloPSA / Microsoft Graph), then returns an execution summary."
  },
  "tags": [],
  "pinData": {},
